  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/PresenLlibreVicentPallares.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) El tinent d&#39;alcalde de Cultura de l&#39;ajuntament d&#39;Onda, LLu&iacute;s Pastor Catalan, ha presentat aquest dissabte Les ll&agrave;grimes d&#39;Orfeu, &uacute;ltima novel&middot;la de Vicent Pallar&eacute;s i Porcar, d&#39;Onda i Suera, <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=72121\" target=\"_blank\">amb la qual ha guanyat el premi Andr&ograve;mina dels Octubre</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6929.jpg\" alt=\"img_6929\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6932.jpg\" alt=\"img_6932\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6935.jpg\" alt=\"img_6935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6942.jpg\" alt=\"img_6942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6944.jpg\" alt=\"img_6944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6947.jpg\" alt=\"img_6947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6949.jpg\" alt=\"img_6949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentaciollibrevicentepallares/img_6952.jpg\" alt=\"img_6952\" style=\"max-width:100%;h